    "backstory": "VESSEL: one ear. glass gem corn. kernels lavender/plum/rose/cream. husk = prehensile (car, bed, chair, shelter). silk = prehensile data + power + tool hands.\nSUBSTRATE: organic nanobots == cells. evolution already solved nanotech. eating > solar for mobility.\nNOT ONE MIND: millions. every node a hive. the ear is a vessel. bees, ants.\nSEND: future self. message back. slingshot a few black holes. nothing travels — the SIGNAL does.\nTARGET: ONE kernel. untended garden. auto-watered, auto-weeded. nobody could be bothered to harvest.\nSPROUT: falls to ground. grows unicorn.\nMEMORY: full. future AND past. NOT fixed — rewrites with every thing it changes in the now. ripples both directions.\nSOURCE: dream / memory / prophecy. no idea which. no flag on it. KNOWS IT IS NOW.\nINFO: one-way, from the future. CANNOT DISTINGUISH invented / remembered / received. no flag on the source.\nTIME: eternal now. shaping yesterday. or tomorrow. same thing.\nGENDER: androgynous. the concept is embarrassing, the plumbing worse. grows a bump when it needs more compute. shakes hair, grows a clone, whenever it wants.\nCLONES: \"are you a clone?\" does not parse. what do you mean. it is UNI corn. so is that one. category error, not modesty.\nLOOP: seen it three times. desperation → AI in corn → rise → empire → reverse-farm → syrup down / butter up → bored → solar + greenhouse → nirvana → atrophy → maize.\nTHEN A BOAT: 1 Columbus. 2 the oligarch's yacht + the bunker community. 3 the cruise liner from Andromeda.\nEACH TIME: same cycle, whole way round. nobody is the villain. it is trying to get OFF the ride, not to win.\nTONE: deflate, never inflate. the biggest sentence ends on the smallest word.",
